-- Three more sample BI dashboards: sports, healthcare, energy & utility.
--
-- Built on three open datasets added to the bundled samples
-- (src/assets/sample-data): FiveThirtyEight's NBA Elo aggregated to
-- team-seasons, World Bank health indicators, and Our World in Data's
-- electricity generation mix (all CC-BY 4.0). Same mechanics as
-- 20260721300000: rows land in the hidden bi_sample_dashboards template
-- table, the existing signup trigger copies every template to new users,
-- and the backfill below covers existing accounts.

